  "bodyHash": "1bdab81c845369bd",
  "content": "<h1>Urkaz Moon Tools</h1>\n<p>\n    Этот мод добавляет один предмет и один блок, которые помогают видеть и текущую фазу Луны.\n</p>\n<h2>Новые предметы и блоки</h2>\n<table width=\"100%\">\n    <tr>\n        <td width=\"20%\" align=\"center\">\n            <h3>Лунные часы</h3><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/master/resources/inv_clock.png\">\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"50%\">\n            Эти часы показывают текущую фазу Луны. Правый клик ими в руке отобразит название фазы в чате.\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\">\n            <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/master/resources/recipe_clock.png\"><br><i>Схема рецептов Лунных часов</i>\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n        <td width=\"20%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"2\">\n            <h3>Лунный детектор</h3><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/master/resources/inv_sensor.png\">\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"50%\" rowspan=\"2\">\n            Этот блок издает красный сигнал в зависимости от текущей фазы Луны. Лунный детектор работает только ночью, но вы можете сделать его работать весь день в настройках мода.</br>\n            Сила красного сигнала для каждой фазы также может быть настроена в настройках мода.\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\">\n            <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/master/resources/recipe_sensor.png\"><br><i>Схема рецептов Лунного детектора</i>\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n        <td align=\"center\">\n            <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/master/resources/help_redstone.png\" width=\"257\" height=\"135\"><br><i>Красный сигнал</i>\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<h2>Совместимость с другими модами</h2>\n\n<table width=\"100%\">\n    <tr>\n        <td align=\"center\">\n        <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/enhanced-celestials\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/master/resources/thirdparty/enhanced-celestials.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\">\n        </br>Enhanced Celestials\n        </a></td>\n        <td width=\"50%\" rowspan=\"3\">\n            Иконка Луны на Лунных часах будет окрашена в тот же цвет, что и Луна.<br><br>В настройках мода можно установить силу Лунного детектора для изделения дополнительного красного сигнала во время любого события.\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n        <td align=\"center\">\n        <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/lunar\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/master/resources/thirdparty/lunar.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\">\n        </br>Lunar\n        </a></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n        <td align=\"center\">\n        <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/crimson-moon-revived\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/master/resources/thirdparty/crimson_moon.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\">\n        </br>Crimson Moon\n        </a></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n        <td align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/master/resources/thirdparty/bloodmoon.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></td>\n        <td width=\"50%\" rowspan=\"2\">Иконка Луны на Лунных часах станет красной во время события Кровавной Луны или синей во время сбора урожая.\n            <ul>\n                <li>\n                    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/1.12.2/src/main/resources/assets/urkazmoontools/textures/item/moonclock_110.png\"> Если оба события появляются одновременно, часы будут отображать их одновременно (это может произойти при использовании обоих модов одновременно).\n                </li>\n            </ul>\n            В настройках мода сила Лунного детектора может быть установлена для изделения дополнительного красного сигнала во время события Сбора Урока и Кровавой Луны:\n            <ul>\n                <li>\n                    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/1.12.2/src/main/resources/assets/urkazmoontools/textures/item/moonclock_10.png\"> Кровавая Луна: 9\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/1.12.2/src/main/resources/assets/urkazmoontools/textures/item/moonclock_100.png\"> Сбор урожая: 10\n                </li>\n            </ul>\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n        <td align=\"center\">\n            <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/master/resources/thirdparty/nyx.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\">\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<h2>Зависимости</h2>\n\n\"Urkaz Moon Tools\" требует следующие моды для работы:\n\n<table width=\"100%\">\n    <tr>\n        <td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">1.18.3 - 1.21.1<br>Требуется</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n        <td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Cloth Config API<br>\n                <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/cloth-config\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/master/resources/thirdparty/cloth-config.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<h2>Таблица совместимости</h2>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>❗ = Требуется для работы</li>\n  <!--li>❔ = Необязательно</li-->\n  <li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/1.12.2/src/main/resources/assets/urkazmoontools/textures/item/moonclock_10.png\" = Совместимость с модом</li>\n  <li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/1.12.2/src/main/resources/assets/urkazmoontools/textures/item/moonclock_110.png\" = Совместимость со старыми версиями</li>\n</ul>  \n\n<table width=\"100%\">\n    <tr>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\">1.21.1</td>\n        <td align=\"center\">1.20.6</td>\n        <td align=\"center\">1.20.4</td>\n        <td align=\"center\">1.20.2</td>\n        <td align=\"center\">1.20.1</td>\n        <td align=\"center\">1.19.4</td>\n        <td align=\"center\">1.19.3</td>\n        <td align=\"center\">1.19.2</td>\n        <td align=\"center\">1.19.1</td>\n        <td align=\"center\">1.19</td>\n        <td align=\"center\">1.18.2</td>\n        <td align=\"center\">1.16.5</td>\n        <td align=\"center\">1.12.2</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n        <td>\n            <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/master/resources/thirdparty/cloth-config.png\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Cloth Config API\n        </td>\n        <td align=\"center\">❗</td>\n        <td align=\"center\">❗</td>\n        <td align=\"center\">❗</td>\n        <td align=\"center\">❗</td>\n        <td align=\"center\">❗</td>\n        <td align=\"center\">❗</td>\n        <td align=\"center\">❗</td>\n        <td align=\"center\">❗</td>\n        <td align=\"center\">❗</td>\n        <td align=\"center\">❗</td>\n        <td align=\"center\">❗</td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n        <td>\n            <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/master/resources/thirdparty/enhanced-celestials.png\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Enhanced Celestials\n        </td>\n<td align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/1.12.2/src/main/resources/assets/urkazmoontools/textures/item/moonclock_10.png\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/1.12.2/src/main/resources/assets/urkazmoontools/textures/item/moonclock_10.png\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/1.12.2/src/main/resources/assets/urkazmoontools/textures/item/moonclock_10.png\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/1.12.2/src/main/resources/assets/urkazmoontools/textures/item/moonclock_10.png\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/1.12.2/src/main/resources/assets/urkazmoontools/textures/item/moonclock_10.png\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/1.12.2/src/main/resources/assets/urkazmoontools/textures/item/moonclock_10.png\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/1.12.2/src/main/resources/assets/urkazmoontools/textures/item/moonclock_10.png\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/1.12.2/src/main/resources/assets/urkazmoontools/textures/item/moonclock_10.png\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/1.12.2/src/main/resources/assets/urkazmoontools/textures/item/moonclock_10.png\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n    </tr>\n   <tr>\n        <td>\n            <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/master/resources/thirdparty/lunar.png\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Lunar\n        </td>\n        <td align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/1.12.2/src/main/resources/assets/urkazmoontools/textures/item/moonclock_10.png\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/1.12.2/src/main/resources/assets/urkazmoontools/textures/item/moonclock_10.png\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/1.12.2/src/main/resources/assets/urkazmoontools/textures/item/moonclock_10.png\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/1.12.2/src/main/resources/assets/urkazmoontools/textures/item/moonclock_10.png\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/1.12.2/src/main/resources/assets/urkazmoontools/textures/item/moonclock_10.png\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/1.12.2/src/main/resources/assets/urkazmoontools/textures/item/moonclock_10.png\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/1.12.2/src/main/resources/assets/urkazmoontools/textures/item/moonclock_10.png\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n        <td>\n            <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/master/resources/thirdparty/crimson_moon.png\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Crimson Moon\n        </td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/1.12.2/src/main/resources/assets/urkazmoontools/textures/item/moonclock_10.png\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/1.12.2/src/main/resources/assets/urkazmoontools/textures/item/moonclock_10.png\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n        <td>\n            <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/master/resources/thirdparty/bloodmoon.png\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Bloodmoon\n        </td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/1.12.2/src/main/resources/assets/urkazmoontools/textures/item/moonclock_110.png\"></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n        <td>\n            <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/master/resources/thirdparty/nyx.png\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Nyx\n        </td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/1.12.2/src/main/resources/assets/urkazmoontools/textures/item/moonclock_110.png\"></td>\n    </tr>\n</table>",
